---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
import { SITE } from "../site-config";
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-2" rowSpan="md:row-span-9" title="About me">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
    <p class="sr-only">
      Hi, I'm {SITE.author.firstName}, a graduate in Computer Engineering from {SITE.location.countryName},
      with Honors in Programming I and in my internship placement. I'm a backend-focused
      developer: I care about the logic and architecture behind an application as much
      as the product itself. During my internship at Xeridia (AI & Software Engineering),
      I built a REST API with FastAPI to serve an NLP-based news classification model,
      and contributed to a multi-agent LLM system that analyzes Microsoft Teams meetings —
      parsing transcripts, detecting risks and blockers, and designing the core API
      architecture. My primary tools include {SITE.stack.join(", ")}.
      I'm currently looking to start my career as a Backend Developer or Software Engineer.
      Beyond coding, I'm an elite university rugby player and coach.
    </p>
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm font-light">
      <p>
        Hi, I'm {SITE.author.firstName}, a graduate in Computer Engineering from {SITE.location.countryName},
        with Honors in Programming I and in my internship placement.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm a backend-focused developer: I care about the logic and architecture
        behind an application as much as the end product. During my internship at
        Xeridia (AI &amp; Software Engineering), I built a REST API with FastAPI to
        serve an NLP-based news classification model, and contributed to a
        multi-agent LLM system that analyzes Microsoft Teams meetings — parsing
        transcripts, detecting risks and blockers, and designing the core API
        architecture.
      </p>
      <div>
        <p class="mb-1">My primary tools of choice:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
          {SITE.stack.map((tech) => <li>{tech}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p>
        I'm currently looking to start my career as a Backend Developer or
        Software Engineer, and I keep building things on my own time to keep learning.
      </p>
      <p>
        Beyond coding, I'm an elite university rugby player and coach.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Card>